  << /ActualText (Professional Experience\nApple \174 Technical Advisor March 2018 \055 August 2025\n\222Provided technical support across Phone Support \0502 years\051 and Chat Support \0505 years\051\n\222Supported the full Apple ecosystem including Mac\054 iPhone\054 iPad\054 Apple Watch\054 AirPods\054 Apple TV\054 HomePod\054 iOS\054 macOS\054 and watchOS\n\222Diagnosed and resolved hardware\054 software\054 account\054 connectivity\054 and ecosystem issues\n\222Assisted approximately 50\054000 customers over seven years\n\222Worked within strict privacy\054 security\054 and compliance requirements\nRecognition\072 AppleCare Excellence Award \0502019\051\nAwarded to a select group of advisors who demonstrated consistently high performance\054 including customer satisfaction scores above 95\045 and strong results across Apple\047s quality and service evaluations\056\n)
